5. ENTITY RELATIONSHIPS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Key Relationships:

     users (1) ──────► (1) alumni_profiles
     users (1) ──────► (1) staff_profiles
     users (1) ──────► (many) events [as creator]
     users (1) ──────► (many) contributions
     users (1) ──────► (many) businesses [as owner]

     regions (1) ────► (many) districts
     districts (1) ──► (many) schools
     schools (1) ────► (many) year_groups
     schools (1) ────► (many) alumni_profiles
     schools (1) ────► (many) projects

     year_groups (1) ► (many) year_group_members
     year_groups (1) ► (many) events

     events (1) ─────► (many) event_registrations
     opportunities (1)► (many) opportunity_applications
     projects (1) ───► (many) contributions
     projects (1) ───► (many) project_updates

     mentorship_offers (1) ► (many) mentorship_requests

